    {
      "id": "colourblind",
      "title": "protan/deutan/tritan/achromatic simulations of the captured HUD",
      "tier": "rendered",
      "command": [
        "tools/colourblind_check.py",
        "tests/out/ui_hud.png",
        "tests/out/ui_hud_glyphs.png"
      ],
      "matrix": [
        [
          "--out",
          "tests/out/colourblind"
        ]
      ],
      "runs": "manual",
      "asserts": false,
      "why_manual": [
        "With no --swatch coordinates it renders simulations and always exits 0, so wiring it",
        "into CI would add a step that cannot fail - the exact shape this register exists to",
        "stop. The claim it is meant to defend (colour is never the only channel) is asserted",
        "in the gate by tests/unit/ui/accessibility_test.gd and tests/unit/ui/status_legibility_test.gd,",
        "and photographed by the gallery's three *_glyphs screens - all of which do run. Give it",
        "--swatch pairs and it can be",
        "promoted to runs: ci."
      ]
    },
